{"ID":"20240205153716-i067rj4","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153716-i067rj4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153716-i067rj4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104609-m2z6vl4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205162544-74ejkqf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:979,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206104609-m2z6vl4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:367,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:367\u0026#125;","title":"大蓟","type":"doc","updated":"20240830163852"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206104609-m2z6vl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104609-m2z6vl4","updated":"20240206104619"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于江苏、浙江、四川等地。\n【性状】\t大蓟草：地上部分呈圆柱形，基部直径可达1.2cm。褐棕色或绿褐色，有很直的棱线 (有数条纵棱)，质略硬而脆。断面灰白色，髓部疏松或中空。叶皱缩，多破碎，绿褐色，完整叶片展平后呈倒披针形或倒卵状椭圆形，羽状深裂，边缘具有不等长针刺，茎，叶均被灰白色蛛丝状毛，质松脆，头状花序球形或椭圆形，总苞黄褐色，苞片披针形，先端微带紫黑色，花冠常脱落，露出灰白色羽状冠毛，气微味淡。气微，味淡。\n大蓟根：呈长纺锤形，常簇生而扭曲，长515cm，直径0.20.6cm。表面暗褐色，有不规则的纵皱纹。质硬而脆，易折断，断面粗糙，灰白色。气微，味甘、微苦。\n根以条粗、干燥者为佳。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，凉。\n【功效】\t止血凉血、祛瘀消肿。主治吐血，衄血，尿血，血淋，血崩，带下，肠风，肠痈，痈疡肿毒，疔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240206104611-7rdma55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206104611-7rdma55"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206104609-ikhxdvg.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162544-74ejkqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162544-74ejkqf","updated":"20240205162544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟-20240205162544-5x4wi4t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711140130-4efje2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711140130-4efje2f","updated":"20240711140130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 542px;","style":"width: 532px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 3-20240711140130-g6iiucs.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 532px;\" parent-style=\"width: 542px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711135243-5m9xorj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711135243-5m9xorj","updated":"20240711140003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 415px;","style":"width: 405px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟-20240711135243-oordv7e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 405px;\" parent-style=\"width: 415px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 727px;","style":"width: 717px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 1-20240711140003-zvqqv5r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 717px;\" parent-style=\"width: 727px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711141843-rw4q9ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141843-rw4q9ws","updated":"20240711142115"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 402px;","style":"width: 392px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 5-20240711141843-yoeuejt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 392px;\" parent-style=\"width: 402px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 791px;","style":"width: 781px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 6-20240711142115-638wzz1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 781px;\" parent-style=\"width: 791px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711142752-50nwbxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711142752-50nwbxa","updated":"20240711142842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 561px;","style":"width: 551px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 10-20240711142842-3oorc26.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 551px;\" parent-style=\"width: 561px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 424px;","style":"width: 414px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 9-20240711142752-s4rstls.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 414px;\" parent-style=\"width: 424px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711143846-j3tj65x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711143846-j3tj65x","updated":"20240711143954"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 442px;","style":"width: 432px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 12-20240711143846-a6uip01.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 432px;\" parent-style=\"width: 442px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 443px;","style":"width: 433px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 13-20240711143954-upn912p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 433px;\" parent-style=\"width: 443px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711141634-dvb1fc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141634-dvb1fc8","updated":"20240711141634"}},{"ID":"20240711141526-ij4ii8h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-ij4ii8h","updated":"20240711141526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"飞廉、大蓟、小蓟对比"}]},{"ID":"20240711141526-fl2m0bx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-fl2m0bx","updated":"20240711141526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"以下为飞廉（茎有刺）"}]},{"ID":"20240711141526-qontb0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-qontb0l","updated":"20240711141526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"飞廉8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/飞廉8-20240619145850-4wgalwt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711141526-ze7teor","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-ze7teor","updated":"20240711141526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"以下为大蓟（茎无刺，叶片羽状裂开）"}]},{"ID":"20240711141526-2t01arn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-2t01arn","updated":"20240711143556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240711135811-pjp4eib.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"大蓟 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/大蓟 4-20240711141353-bfx5emr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 437px;\" parent-style=\"width: 447px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711141526-qhlldgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-qhlldgb","updated":"20240711141526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"以下为小蓟（叶片有刺无裂）"}]},{"ID":"20240711141526-qafj7nw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711141526-qafj7nw","updated":"20240711141526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 565px;","style":"width: 555px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"小蓟"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/小蓟-20240711141042-ccm65j1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 555px;\" parent-style=\"width: 565px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240711135528-sw1znen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711135528-sw1znen","updated":"20240711135924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：大蓟与飞廉较为相似，两者最明显的区别在于，飞廉的全株包括茎上都有尖刺，飞廉的茎上则是细细的绒毛，只有叶的边缘长有尖刺；"}]},{"ID":"20240711140422-gfj92qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711140422-gfj92qv","updated":"20240725082427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：大蓟与小蓟相比，大蓟个头比小蓟高，叶子边缘有刺，叶片如羽毛般裂开；小蓟则有刺无裂；"}]},{"ID":"20240711135528-jjjoep3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240711135528-jjjoep3"}},{"ID":"20240830163842-1pc4jsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-1pc4jsk","updated":"20240830163852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：大蓟"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-gz9ni7d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-gz9ni7d","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-bxj5grw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-bxj5grw","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-lpiad54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-lpiad54","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HERBACIRSIIJAPONICI/RADIXCIRSIIJAPONICI"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-szx6flu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-szx6flu","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】大刺儿菜、大刺盖、老虎脷、山萝卜、刺萝卜、牛喳口、鸡母刺、大恶鸡婆、山老鼠簕"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ookl8va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ookl8va","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为菊科植物蓟CirsiumjaponicumDC.的干燥地上部分或根。夏、秋二季花开时采割地上部分，或秋末挖根，除去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-98qu7s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-98qu7s6","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-p98ip14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-p98ip14","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟草茎呈圆柱形，基部直径可达1.2cm；表面绿褐色或棕褐色，有数条纵棱，被丝状毛；断面灰白色，髓部疏松或中空。叶皱缩，多破碎，完整叶片展平后呈倒披针形或倒卵状椭圆形，羽状深裂，边缘具不等长的针刺；上表面灰绿色或黄棕"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-d9p1v6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-d9p1v6j","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色，下表面色较浅，两面均具灰白色丝状毛。头状花序顶生，球形或椭圆形，总苞黄褐色，羽状冠毛灰白色。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-5ndc8qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-5ndc8qo","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟根呈长纺锤形，常簇生而扭曲，长5～15cm，直径0.2～0.6cm。表面暗褐色，有不规则的纵皱纹。质硬而脆，易折断，断面粗糙，灰白色。气微，味甘、微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-qkbgm1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-qkbgm1i","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-r9x4dtx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-r9x4dtx","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品根的横切面：表皮细胞壁木栓化，有时脱落。皮层较宽，紧靠内皮层处有类圆形分泌道，直径80～130μm，较密地排列成环；内皮层明显。韧皮部较窄。形成层断续成环。木质部射线较宽；导管少数，放射状排列，周围常伴有木纤束髓。薄壁细胞含菊糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-fj0xo43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-fj0xo43","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶的表面观：上表皮细胞多角形；下表皮细胞类长方形，壁波状弯曲。气孔不定式或不等式，副卫细胞3～5个。非腺毛4～18细胞，顶端细胞细长而扭曲，直径约7μm，壁具交错的角质纹理。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-3mtti2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-3mtti2v","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-qor56rl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-qor56rl","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟草：洗净，润软，切段，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-b18c9k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-b18c9k1","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟根：洗净，润透，切薄片，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-srhp6t5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-srhp6t5","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟炭：取大蓟段或根片，照炒炭法（附录ⅡD）炒至表面焦黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-501ohpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-501ohpc","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘，苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ehhoe9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ehhoe9q","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归心、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-e7x6exb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-e7x6exb","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】凉血止血，祛瘀消肿。用于衄血，吐血，尿血，便血，崩漏下血，外伤出血，痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-kzqjuxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-kzqjuxc","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～15g；外用鲜品适量，捣烂敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-cooggmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-cooggmd","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-rl4hd6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-rl4hd6e","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-6kpw632","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-6kpw632","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）同属植物中下列数种在不同地区也作大蓟入药。1.野蓟CirsiummaackiiMaxim.[C.japonicumDC.var.maackii（Maxim.）Nakai]。2.虎蓟CirsiumspicatumMatsum。3.烟管蓟CirsiumpendulumFisch.。4.青刺蓟（滇大蓟、白马刺）CirsiumchlorolepisPetrak。5.藏大蓟Cirsiumeriophoroideum（Hook.f.）Petrak。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-2vqwarw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-2vqwarw","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）此外，陕西、甘肃、青海、新疆等地尚有以同科飞廉属植物飞廉CarduuscrispusL.的全草，山东以麝香飞廉CarduusnutansL.的全草混作大蓟入药。东北地区还有以小蓟（刺儿菜及刻叶刺儿菜）作大蓟者，按小蓟虽亦有凉血止血之功，但不能消肿，此与大蓟之功效有所差异，故应分别使用，不可混淆。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-atiw4p1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-atiw4p1","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-veiufiu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-veiufiu","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-4tlt2vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-4tlt2vd","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-i9dzdez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-i9dzdez","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】JapaneseThistleHerb"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-0gbcdtr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-0gbcdtr","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】将军草、牛口刺、马刺草"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-y36ordi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-y36ordi","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为菊科植物蓟CirsiumjapokicumDC.的地上部分。夏、秋季割取地上部分，晒干或鲜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-vwdbnvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-vwdbnvh","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本，高0.5～1m。根簇生，圆锥形，肉质，表面棕褐色。茎直立，有细纵纹，基部有白色丝状毛。基生叶丛生，有柄，倒披针形或倒卵状披针形，长15～30cm，羽状深裂，边缘齿状，齿端具针刺，上面疏生白我丝状毛，下面脉上有长毛；茎生叶互生，基部心形抱茎。头状花序顶生；总苞钟状，外被蛛丝状毛；总苞片4～6层，披针形，外层较短；花两性，管状，紫色；花药顶端有附片，基部有尾。瘦果长椭圆形，冠毛多层，羽状，暗灰色。花期5～8月，果期6～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-yijkmva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-yijkmva","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山野、路旁、荒地。产于全国大部分地区。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-72evjs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-72evjs9","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含挥发油、物生碱；鲜叶含柳穿鱼甙（pectolinarin）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-tqlhxpx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-tqlhxpx","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】性凉，味甘、苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-kriyyqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-kriyyqw","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】凉血止血，祛瘀消肿。用于衄血、吐血、尿血、便血、崩漏下血、外伤出血、痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-xgg47r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-xgg47r4","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】根亦入药，功效同地上部分。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-cpkbu34","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-cpkbu34","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-4xfc1qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-4xfc1qz","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-rhe0t3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-rhe0t3j","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-pg3gqs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-pg3gqs5","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-u6jlo3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-u6jlo3h","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】马蓟（《范汪方》），虎蓟（陶弘景），刺蓟、山牛蒡（《日华子本草》），鸡项草（《本草图经》），鸡脚刺（《滇南本草》），野红花（《纲目》），茨芥（《本草述》），牛触嘴、鼓椎（《医林纂要》），鸡姆刺（《质问本草，），恶鸡婆（《草木便方》），大牛喳口、山萝卜（《贵州民间方药集》），猪姆刺、六月霜、蚁姆刺（《福建民间草药》），牛口刺（《浙江中药手册》），老虎喇（《广西中兽医药植》），刺萝卜（《民间常用草药汇编》），驴扎嘴、马刺刺（《山西中药志》），刺秸子，马刺草（《中药材手册》），牛口舌、老虎刺、草鞋刺、"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-l7dgfcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-l7dgfcw","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为菊科植物大蓟的全草或根。全草于夏秋两季当花盛开讨采割，除去老茎，晒干，以秋季采者为佳；根于8～10月采挖，除去泥土、残茎，洗净晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ve95dtd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ve95dtd","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生宿根草本。茎高100～150厘米，直立，有纵条纹，密被白软毛。叶互生；根生叶倒卵状长椭圆形，长15～30厘米，羽状分裂，裂片5～6对，先端尖，边缘具不等长浅裂和斜刺，基部渐狭，形成两侧有翼的扁叶柄，被毛；茎生叶向上逐渐变小，形状与根生叶相似，基部抱茎，下表面密被白绵毛。头状花序，单生在枝端；柄短；着生披针状叶片1～2；总苞球形，径15～20毫米，苞片6～7列，披针形，在基部外面的较短，内面的较长，锐头，有刺，全缘；全部为管状花，紫红色，两性，长约20毫米，先端5裂，裂片线形；雄蕊6，花药相连呈管状，先端分离，基部左右各有一下垂尖尾；雌蕊1，子房下位。瘦果扁椭圆形.花期5～6月。果期6～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-2hilvbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-2hilvbo","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山野、路旁。全国大部分地区有分布。全国大部分地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-og98gxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-og98gxk","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-p3jjarh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-p3jjarh","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①干燥全草，茎圆柱形，粗约4～10毫米，表面紫褐色或褐色，有纵皱纹，密被灰白色丝状络毛；质松而脆；折断面黄白色，中央有白色疏松的髓却。叶片多数脱落，残留的叶绿褐色或焦褐色，多破碎皱缩，边缘具不等长的针刺，质脆而易脱落。头状花序存留于枝端，管状花多萎落不存，总苞枯黄色，表面微带紫黑色，白色羽毛状冠毛外露。气微弱，味淡。以色灰绿、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-f8y4juv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-f8y4juv","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②干燥块根呈长圆锥形，或微弯曲，表面黑褐色，具细密的纵纹，有时有屈曲的纵槽；顶端和根茎相连部分带纤维性，末端细瘦部分通常切除，长6～10厘米，直径5～15毫米。质稍硬而脆，折断面较整齐，黄白色，略带颗粒状。以粗壮、无须根、芦头者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ol18kll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ol18kll","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-rlgr0de","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-rlgr0de","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟：拣去杂质，清水洗净，润透，切段，晒干。大蓟炭：取净大蓟置锅内用武火炒至七成变黑色，存性，过铁丝筛，喷洒清水，取出晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-hnu0z10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-hnu0z10","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草通玄》：\"酒洗或童便拌，微炒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ugyi6h8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ugyi6h8","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-voh45fy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-voh45fy","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-wq2mh0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-wq2mh0y","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"根，味甘，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-jmjlo6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-jmjlo6l","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"味苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-yftahd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-yftahd2","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本萃》：\"叶，凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-q6n98rf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-q6n98rf","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草汇言》：\"味甘微苦，气寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-tjoce5n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-tjoce5n","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-xua0pi7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-xua0pi7","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-llonvz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-llonvz0","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《滇南本草》：\"入肝、脾、肾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-18ay9xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-18ay9xa","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入肺、脾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-e9h4c6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-e9h4c6l","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-2k5igxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-2k5igxx","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凉血，止血，祛瘀，消痈肿。治吐血，衄血，尿血，血淋，血崩，带下，肠风，肠痈，痈疡肿毒，疔疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-yk0vwmn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-yk0vwmn","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》：\"根，主养精保血。主女子赤白沃，安胎，止吐血鼻衄。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-w5yzvl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-w5yzvl4","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"根，止崩中血下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-231cyo9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-231cyo9","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《唐本草》：\"根，疗痈肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-9ra9xfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-9ra9xfv","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"叶，治肠痈，腹藏瘀血，血运扑损，可生研，酒并小便任服；恶疮疥癣，盐研窨敷。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-nxxs2vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-nxxs2vy","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《滇南本草》：\"消瘀血，生新血，止吐血、鼻血。治小儿尿血，妇人红崩下血，生补诸经之血，消疮毒，散瘰疬结核，疮痈久不收口者，生肌排脓。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ftaz8ne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ftaz8ne","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《玉楸药解》：\"治金疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-vq1p8ls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-vq1p8ls","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《医林纂要》：\"坚肾水，去血热，泄逆气。治肠风，肠痈。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-i33suid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-i33suid","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《福建民间草药》：\"凉血止血，消炎退肿。治肺热咳血，热结血淋，疔疖疮癌，漆疮，汤火烫伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-5o5v3oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-5o5v3oy","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱（鲜者1～2两）；捣汁或研末。外用：捣敷或捣汁涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-kvr9iuo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-kvr9iuo","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-sgru5k4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-sgru5k4","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾胃虚寒而无瘀滞者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-wxgoiwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-wxgoiwr","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《品汇精要》：\"忌犯铁器。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-c5dc12f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-c5dc12f","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"不利于胃弱泄泻及血虚极，脾胃弱不思饮食之证。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-vc76eem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-vc76eem","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-nh0f5qo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-nh0f5qo","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治心热吐血、口干：刺蓟叶及根，捣，绞取汁，每服一小盏，频服。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-wnaiem2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-wnaiem2","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治吐血衄血，崩中下血：大蓟一握。捣，绞取汁，服半升。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-0atelm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-0atelm6","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治肺热咳血：大蓟鲜根一两。洗净后杵碎，酌加冰糖半两，和水煎成半碗，温服，日服两次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-w9mxj31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-w9mxj31","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治热结血淋：大蓟鲜根一至三两。洗净捣碎，酌冲开水炖一小时，饭前服，日服三次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-2vpbjr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-2vpbjr9","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治妇人红崩下血，白带不止：大蓟五钱，土艾叶三钱，白鸡冠花子二钱，木耳二钱，炒黄柏五钱（如白带，不用黄柏）。引水酒煨服。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-xgtz6m7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-xgtz6m7","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治肠痈、内疽诸证：大蓟根叶、地榆、牛膝、金银花。俱生捣汁，和热酒服。如无生鲜者，以干叶煎饮亦可。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-mqtfuht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-mqtfuht","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治肺痈：鲜大蓟四两。煎汤，早晚饭后服。（《闽东本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-wobrxcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-wobrxcc","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治疔疖疮疡，灼热赤肿：大蓟鲜根和冬蜜捣匀贴患处，日换两次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-lhr0psp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-lhr0psp","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治跌扑损伤，瘀血作痛：大蓟汁，和热酒饮。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-b9yummr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-b9yummr","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治结核于项左右，或栗子疮红肿溃烂出脓久不收口者：独根大蓟，不拘多少，或煮水牛肉，或猪肉，或单用，煨点水酒服。外用新鲜大蓟捣烂，入发灰、儿茶、血竭同拌，敷疮口，生肌。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-6wa7u7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-6wa7u7a","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治汤火烫伤：大蓟新鲜根，以冷开水洗净后捣烂，包麻布炖热绞汁涂抹，日二、三次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-7fo54fh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-7fo54fh","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治妇女干血痨或肝痨，恶寒发热，头疼，形体消瘦，精神短少：新鲜大蓟二两，黄牛肉四两。共入罐内煮烂，天明吃毕后复熟睡。忌盐。（《滇南本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-7j0x2cv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-7j0x2cv","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治漆疮：大蓟鲜根一握。洗净，加些桐油捣烂，用麻布包炖热绞汁涂抹，日三、四次。（《福建民间草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-iw1t1fx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-iw1t1fx","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治副鼻窦炎：鲜大蓟根三两，鸡蛋二至三个。二味同煮，吃蛋喝汤。忌吃辛辣等刺激性食物。（《全展选编·五官科》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ykngqad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ykngqad","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治带状疱疹：大蓟、小蓟、鲜牛奶各适量。将大、小蓟放在鲜牛奶中泡软后，捣成膏，外敷。（内蒙古《中草药新医疗法资料选编》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-m207izd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-m207izd","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-0nw30lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-0nw30lk","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治疗肺结核"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-xo82cx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-xo82cx1","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用新鲜大蓟根，洗净，每日4两，加水400毫升，文火煎至200毫升，2次分服；或制成注射剂，每10毫升含生药10克，作肌肉注射或气管内滴入。先后观察18例，其中煎剂治疗者5例，针剂治疗者11例，气管内滴入者2例，用药15～72天不等。结果，从X线胸片对比来看，治疗后病变显着吸收者3例，吸收者8例，无变化者7例。部分病例的咳嗽、排痰、胸痛及发热等症，也有不同程度的好转。治程中个别服煎剂者感冒胀不适，若加生姜、陈皮、法半夏等可以减轻。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-6xp6i2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-6xp6i2s","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗高血压病"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-x2n8t1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-x2n8t1d","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取新鲜干根加水浸泡约半小时，煎煮三次，每次煮沸半小时，滤液合并浓缩成每100毫升相当于生药0.5两的煎剂；早晚各服一次，每次100毫升。亦可用新鲜干根或叶制成浸膏片。根制片每日3次，每次4片，日量相当于干根1两；叶制片每日3次，每次3片，日量相当于干叶15克左右。临床观察102例，除部分头晕、心悸及失眠等症较重的患者，适当配合镇静药物如澳剂、眠尔通或利眠宁等外，均单用大蓟治疗。疗程一周至三月不等。其中初用煎剂以后改用根制片治疗者72例，结果显效（收缩压下降40毫米汞柱以上或舒张压下降20毫米汞柱以上）17例，有效（收缩压下降20毫米汞柱以上但不满40毫米汞柱，或舒张压下降10毫米汞柱以上而不满20毫米汞柱，或早期高血压病6例血压下降至140／90毫米汞柱）45例，无效10例，有效率86.1％。用叶制片观察30例，结果显效（标准同上）5例，有效10例，无效15例，疗效较差。副作用：少数空腹服用片剂后出现胃内不适或恶心等药物反应，改为饭后服药，即可减轻。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-z1msx06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-z1msx06","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】华北地区及山东、江苏、安徽、四川、浙扛、福建等地多用全草；中南及西南地区多用根。考诸古代本草书籍亦以用根为主，故有\"土人参\"、\"土洋参\"之名。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-9vr7y4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-9vr7y4q","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-7b593rm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-7b593rm","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大蓟《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-et5wxmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-et5wxmg","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-zw108f5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-zw108f5","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】DàJì"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-d3zmn45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-d3zmn45","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】JapaneseThistleHerborRoot,HerbofJapaneseThistle,RootofJapaneseThistle"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-k1uyqwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-k1uyqwu","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】马蓟、虎蓟、刺蓟、山牛蒡、鸡项草、鸡脚刺、野红花、茨芥、牛触嘴、鼓椎、鸡姆刺、恶鸡婆、大牛喳口、山萝卜、猪姆刺、六月霜、蚁姆刺、牛口刺、老虎脷、刺萝卜、驴扎嘴、马刺刺、刺秸子、马刺草、牛口舌、老虎刺、草鞋刺、刷把头、土红花、野刺菜、牛不嗅、猪妈菜、牛刺竻菜、竻菜、鸟不扑"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ay880sh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ay880sh","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-g6votk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-g6votk9","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为菊科植物大蓟的地上部分或根。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-atifjl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-atifjl4","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：CirsiujaponicumFisch.exDC."}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-w3v3aps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-w3v3aps","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：栽种第3年，秋季挖掘根部，除去泥土、残茎，洗净，晒干。夏、秋季盛花时割取地上部分，鲜用或晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-aw72ri4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-aw72ri4","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】大蓟多年生草本。块根纹锤状或萝卜状，直径达7mm。茎直立，高30-80cm，茎枝有条棱，被长毛。基产叶有柄，叶片倒披针形或倒卵状椭圆形，长8-20cm，宽2.5-8cm，羽状深裂或几全裂，侧裂片6-12对，中部侧裂片较大，向上及向下的侧裂片渐小，边缘齿状，齿端具刺；自基部向上的叶渐小，与基生叶同形并等样分裂，但无柄，基部扩大半抱茎；全部茎叶两面同色，绿色，两面沿脉有疏毛。头状花序睦立，单一或数个生于枝端集成圆锥状；总苞钟状，直径3cm；；总苞片约6层，覆瓦状排列，向内层渐长，外层与中层卵状三角形至长三角形，先端有短刺，内层披针形或线状披针形，先端渐尖呈软针刺状；花两性，全部为管状花，花冠紫色或紫红色，长1.5-2cm，5裂，裂片较下面膨大部分短；雄蕊5，花药先端有附片，基部有尾。瘦果长椭圆形，稍扁，苌约4mm；冠毛羽状，暗灰色，稍短于花冠。花期5-8月，果期6-8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-dr6pfeo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-dr6pfeo","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-0biovx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-0biovx0","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山坡、草地、路旁。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-gh8r4v7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-gh8r4v7","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于河北、陕西、山东、江苏、浙江、江西、福建、台湾、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-1i2qx6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-1i2qx6o","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-4i2di7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-4i2di7q","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖湿润气候，耐寒，耐旱。适应性较强，对土壤要求不严。愉土层深厚，疏松肥沃的砂质壤土或壤土栽培为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-nplekav","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-nplekav","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子、分株、根芽繁殖，以种子繁殖为主。种子繁殖：春播3-4月；秋播9月，以秋播为好。7-8月种子成熟后，割下头状花序，晒干，脱粒，扭净，备用。穴播：按行株距30cm×30cm开穴，穴深3-5cm，种子用草木灰拦匀后播入穴内，覆土。分株繁殖：3-4月挖掘母株，分成小丛，每穴1丛，覆土压实，浇水。根芽繁殖：利用带芽的根进行栽种。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-zhrrj5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-zhrrj5s","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理生长期进行中耕除草2-3次，结合追施人畜粪肥，倒苗后要增施堆肥、厩肥等。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-5jkymux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-5jkymux","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-82sl2n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-82sl2n5","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别大蓟草：茎圆柱形，直径0.5-1.5cm，表面绿褐色或棕褐色，有纵棱，被灰白色毛；质松脆，断面黄白色，髓部白色，常中空。叶急缩，多破碎，完整叶片展平后呈倒披针形或倒卵状椭圆形，羽状深裂，边缘具不等长的针刺，上表面灰绿色或黄桂冠色，下表面色较浅，两面有白色毛。头状花序顶生，圆球形或椭圆形，总苞枯黄色，苞片披针形，4-6层，冠毛羽状，黄白色。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-4r7z8qe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-4r7z8qe","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以色绿、叶多者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-50fizh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-50fizh9","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"磊蓟根：根长纺锤形，常簇生而扭曲，长5-15cm，直径约1cm，表面暗褐色，有纵皱纹。质硬而脆，易折断，断面较粗糙，皮部薄，棕褐色，有细小裂隙，木部类白色。气特异，味微苦涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-7geuzbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-7geuzbq","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以条粗、芦关短者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-9oheaxp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-9oheaxp","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别叶表面观：上表皮细胞类多角形，下表皮细胞不规则形或类长言形，垂周壁波状弯曲，上下表皮都有微细的角质纹理。气孔不定式或不等式，副卫细胞3-5个。多细胞非腺毛极长，多已碎断，完整者由4-18或更多的细胞组成，基部细胞直径15-150μm以上，顶端细胞极长而扭曲，直径13-24μm，壁具交错的角质纹理。叶肉细胞含草酸钙簇晶，直径13-24μm，草酸钙针晶长约15μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-vvibglg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-vvibglg","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根横切面：表皮细胞木栓化，常脱落。皮层较宽，紧靠内皮层外侧有类圆形的分泌腔，直径70-140μm，较必地排列成环，内皮层凯氏带明显。韧皮部较窄，形成层连成环，木质部导管少数，数个成群呈径向排列，周围常伴有木纤维，射线宽阔，中央有髓。薄壁细胞含菊糖。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ji99sv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ji99sv8","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】新鲜叶含柳穿鱼甙（pectolinarin）[1]。地上部分含有φ-蒲公英甾醇乙酸酯（φ-taraxasterylacetate），β-香树脂醇乙酸酯（β-amyrinacetate），三十二烷醇（dotriacontanol），豆甾醇（stigmasterol），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），柳穿鱼素（pectolinari-genin）[2]。根含油，内有单紫杉烯（aplotaxene），二氢单紫杉烯（dihydroaplotaxene），四氢单紫杉烯（tetrahydroaploaplotaxene），六氢单紫杉烯（hexahdroaploataxene），1-十五碳烯（1-pentadecene），香附子烯（cyperene），丁香烯（caryophyllene），罗汉柏烯（thujop-sene），α-雪松烯（α-himachalene）[3]，顺式的8，9-环氧-1-十七碳烯-11，13-二炔-10-醇（8，9-epoxy-heptadeca-1-en-11,13-diyn-10-ol）[4].根中还含蒲公英甾醇乙酸酯（ataxasterylacetate），φ-蒲公英甾醇乙酸酯[5]，菊糖（inulin）[6]。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-wysu03d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-wysu03d","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-gc6qr3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-gc6qr3y","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对心血管的作用1.1对离体蛙心活动的影响蛙12只，按Starub法，制备离体蛙心，Ringer's液中加大蓟，浓度大于20mg/L时，心率无明显改变，浓度达200mg/L时，心收缩幅度变小，心率减慢，继而出现不同程度的房室传导阻滞，如换以Ringer's液，可恢复正常心律的收缩幅度。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-a2u0kmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-a2u0kmw","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2对离体兔心灌流实验家兔6只，雌雄不拘，按Langendorff's法，进行离体兔心灌流，待心脏活动稳定后，从心脏插管的侧支注入大蓟0.5g/kg，立即记录给药后心率和心收缩振幅，并与给药前比较。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-gmkogfe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-gmkogfe","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.3在体犬心实验犬6只，应用3%戊巴比妥钠30mg/kg进行麻醉。开胸人工呼吸，应用生理药理多用仪同步记录血压和心脏收缩曲线，iv大蓟1.5g/kg后，血压明显降低，由原来的15.8±0.9kPa降低到11.8±0.8kPa（X±SD，n＝6，P＜0.05＝。心收缩振幅由原来的100±1%降到39±7%，心率由原来的103±7%减到72±6%，全部实验过程中可见到这种降压效应。在给药后即刻升高趋势，而1分钟后开始逐渐下降，血压下降作用可持续近20±7分钟，而反复给药这种降压效应并不明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-wav69os","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-wav69os","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.4大蓟的快速耐受性犬3只，血压为17.9±0.9kPa，第1次iv大蓟1.5g/kg后血压下降，12±1.1kPa，待血压恢复至原始水平后，再第2次iv同量本药时，有2只犬血压反下降3.7±0.8kPa，另有1只犬血压下降值与第1次iv降压值相同，提示其有产生快速耐受性的可能。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-23mw411","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-23mw411","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5对闭塞颈总动脉（BCO）加压反射的影响麻醉犬，每隔5分钟用动脉夹闭塞双侧颈总动脉15s，如此共2次，测得iv大蓟前BCO升压值（从16.6±1.6升高到20.8±2.4kPa），然后iv大蓟1.5g/kg，当血压下降最低时，BCO使血压从9.1±2.1升到10.3±2.4kPa。按公式：加压反应值（%）=［血压升高值/原血压-60］X100加校正计算。结果在给药前加压反应为48%，而给药后为33%，提示大蓟有抑制BCO加压反射的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-yv6ga31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-yv6ga31","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水浸剂、乙醇一水浸出液和乙醇浸出液，应用于狗、猫、兔等均有降低血压的作用。大蓟水、大蓟鲜根或干根水煎剂、根碱液、酸性醇浸出液及叶水煎剂对麻醉狗均有降压作用，叶碱液、全草碱液及全草水煎液作用不明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-ut2pcuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-ut2pcuz","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.抗菌作用体外试验大蓟（品种未鉴定）根煎剂或全草蒸馏液，在1：4000浓度时能抑制人型有毒结核菌的生长。酒精浸剂1：30000时对人型结核菌即有抑制作用，但水煎剂的抑菌浓度要比此大。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-zmj7rhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-zmj7rhu","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对腹水癌细胞的作用取健康的小白鼠接种腹水癌细胞液0.1ml.7-8d后生长癌液较多，抽出癌液加1滴至玻璃片上，并加1滴20%大蓟煎剂以及1滴伊红台氏溶液，在显微镜下观察癌细胞的死亡情况，如被杀死则细胞染成红色，未杀死则仍为无色透明状。同时，采用唾液腺细胞和精巢细胞2种正常细胞，进行对照试验。结果表明，大蓟可全部杀死腹水癌细胞，并对精巢细胞亦有同样作用。但对唾液腺细胞无损害。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-6dozj20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-6dozj20","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别薄层色谱：取大蓟地上部分粗粉1g，加乙醇，于水浴上温浸2h，滤过，滤液蒸干，加乙醇0.5ml溶解供点样用。另取绿原酸及芦丁乙醇液作对照品。分别点亲于硅胶G-0.5%CMC板上，用正丁醇-冰乙酸-水（3：1：1）展开，于紫外灯（365nm）下，绿原酸显蓝色荧光，喷%三氯化铝乙醇试液后，芦丁显黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-b8yq3gk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-b8yq3gk","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，清水洗净，润透，切段，晒干。大蓟炭：取净大蓟置锅内用武火炒至七成变黑色,存性，过铁丝筛,喷洒清水，取出晒干。《本草通玄》：酒洗或童便拌，微炒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-p0djkzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-p0djkzo","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味甘；微苦；性凉"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-midbhnz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-midbhnz","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归心；肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-alxeo5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-alxeo5x","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】凉血止血；行瘀消肿。主吐血；咯血；衄血；便血；尿血；妇女崩漏；外伤出血；疮疡肿痛；瘰疬；湿疹；肝炎；肾炎"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-vk2whs0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-vk2whs0","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，5-10g；鲜品可用30-60g。外用：适量，捣敷衍。用于止血宜炒炭用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-m31i2oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-m31i2oc","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】脾胃虚寒而无瘀滞者忌服。1.《品汇精要》：忌犯铁器。2.《本草经疏》：不利于胃弱泄泻及血虚极、脾胃弱。不思食之证。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-s9p6wph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-s9p6wph","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-2euiftb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-2euiftb","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《唐本草》：根，疗痈肿。大、小蓟皆能破血，但大蓟兼疗痈肿，而小蓟专主血，不能消痈肿也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-3222idq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-3222idq","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：大蓟根，陶云有毒，误也。女子赤白沃，血热所致也，胎因热则不安，血热妄行，溢出上窍则吐衄。大蓟根最能凉血，血热解，则诸证自愈矣。其性凉而能行，行而带补，补血凉血，则荣气和，荣气和故令肥健也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-nyn5mcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-nyn5mcq","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草述》：大、小蓟类以为血药，固然。第如桃仁、红花，皆言其行血破滞，而此味则曰止吐血、鼻衄，并女子崩中血下，似乎功在止血也。夫小蓟退热固以止血，而大蓟下气更是止血妙理，盖气之不下者，多由于阴之不降，以致阳亢而不下也，气下则血归经矣，此非气为血先之义欤。夫凉血者多滞，而此乃能行之，又不以降火为行，是从下气以为行也。即小蓟根，在《食疗本草》亦谓其养气，但力劣于大蓟耳。以故行血者无补，而此乃能保之，特大蓟健养之力胜于保血者耳，是所谓不就血以为止者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-vo0z6n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-vo0z6n9","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草求真》：大、小蓟，虽书载属甘温，可以养精保血，然究其精之养，血之保，则又赖于血荣一身，周流无滞。若使血瘀不消，而致见有吐衄唾咯崩漏之证，与血积不行，而致见有痈疼肿痛之病，则精血先？不治，安有保养之说乎。用此气味温和，温不致燥，行不过散，瘀滞得温则消，瘀块得行斯活。恶露既净，自有生新之能，痈肿潜消，自有固益之妙，保养之说，义由此起，岂真具有补益之力哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-qzy3gcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-qzy3gcf","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草正义》：二蓟主治，皆以下行导瘀为主，《别录》以大蓟根止吐血鼻衄者，正以下行为顺，而上行之吐衄可止。又谓安胎，则破瘀导滞之性适得其反，恐不可从。甄权谓主下血，亦殊未允。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-qggs1x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-qggs1x7","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.其他：《别录》：根，主养精保血。主女子赤白沃，安胎，止吐血鼻衄。《药性论》：根,止崩中血下。《日华子本草》：叶，治肠痈，腹藏瘀血，血运扑损，可生研，酒并小便任服；恶疮疥癣，盐研窨敷。《滇南本草》：消瘀血，生新血，止吐血、鼻血。治小儿尿血，妇人红崩下血，生补诸经之血，消疮毒，散瘰疬结核,疮痈久不收口者，生肌排脓。《玉揪药解》：治金疮。《医林纂要》：坚肾水，去血热，泄逆气。治肠风，肠痈。《福建民间草药》：凉血止血，消炎退肿。治肺热咳血，热结血淋，疔疖疮疡，漆疮，汤火烫伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240830163842-r1n5snj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163842-r1n5snj","updated":"20240830163928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830163844-amsoxmu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830163844-amsoxmu","updated":"20240830163928"}},{"ID":"20240830163845-z6tix7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830163845-z6tix7h","updated":"20240830163928"}}]}